{"id": "Dd-s1FDz1dC", "title": "Video by yungraja", "description": "Adelphi Shades.\n\nAn original story by Vision Machina in collaboration with @yungraja, featuring original music by Yung Raja and the beginning of something much bigger between us.\n\nTogether, we’re exploring how his music can go beyond the music video, building new characters, stories and worlds where the music itself can lead the narrative forward.\n\nAdelphi Shades is the first glimpse into that.\n\nA full screenplay written and directed by @don.machina, brought to life through our hybrid filmmaking approach. Combining filmed motion transfer, 3D blocking and genAI to give us maximum creative control and freedom.\n\nThis is only the prologue.\n\nA lot more coming. We’re just getting started. #adelphishades", "channel": "yungraja", "uploader_id": "6568922", "uploader": "yung raja", "timestamp": 1790919782, "like_count": 523, "comment_count": 12, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/146.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1418868580217236a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 75.159, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMwVy1sa3KKU4c2YtLOH9ZUfFppQWhRr4V31KyKto1MRtQ8sNxFJ9V1Qi2d_HxYY9txKrEO5cwMN7RVIci0ChKc_BFjYPr4pMICI3s.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=AdoVntzgIwsGg_wbxMSpELSwzk_SpLcQacuLp99RjXmjyyV6jiVq48NLVxN9PaAsoiOLbkrW1yQufo7TU_89N7Zq&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=BGFAyVQ830sQ7kNvwFQ7EmY&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=iWjHX0WDqS5pt42IrVlMig&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQW1LHwg6CssBqPGBy9dzRRhC02BVw8DZ1HH4gSyV1RkQ&oe=6AF408B6", "manifest_stream_num